## From intent to impact.

A disciplined six-stage engagement framework ensuring strategic objectives survive ground-level operational friction.

### Diagnose
Understand the challenge.
Deep baseline auditing, stakeholder interviews, policy context analysis, and district-level operational diagnostic.

### Design
Build strategy and operating model.
Formulating modular program architecture, partnership agreements, resource allocation matrices, and risk registers.

### Align
Bring stakeholders together.
Facilitating cross-departmental consensus across corporate leadership, government nodal agencies, and academia.

### Implement
Execute through structured PMU.
Deploying on-ground program teams, digital MIS telemetry, master trainer bootcamps, and daily milestone tracking.

### Measure
Track outcomes and evidence.
Independent evaluation, social return on investment (SROI), statistical verification, and executive dashboard reviews.

### Scale
Expand models sustainably.
Institutional handover, institutionalized curriculum embedding, and state-wide or multi-region replication playbooks.

